                            <span class="text-3xl mr-3">&#9989;</span> Our Modern &quot;Auto-Graft&quot; Way
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">We remove the pterygium and then place a micro-thin, healthy graft of your <em>own</em> tissue over the area. This graft acts as a natural barrier, preventing regrowth.</p>
                        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                            <li class="flex"><span class="font-bold text-teal-600 mr-2">&#10003;</span> <strong>Drastically Reduced Recurrence (&lt;1%)</strong></li>
                            <li class="flex"><span class="font-bold text-teal-600 mr-2">&#10003;</span> Heals into a clear, white, natural eye</li>
                            <li class="flex"><span class="font-bold text-teal-600 mr-2">&#10003;</span> <strong>No Stitches</strong> — uses biologic glue</li>
                        </ul>
