                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                    <div class="card p-4">
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-center">&quot;I was so self-conscious about my red eye. Now, I can&apos;t even tell it was ever there.&quot;</p>
