                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-center">&quot;The procedure was quick and painless. My only regret is not doing it sooner.&quot;</p>
                        <p class="text-teal-700 font-semibold text-center mt-4">— James R., Westlake Village</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card p-4">
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-center">&quot;I was worried it would grow back, but it&apos;s been 2 years and my eye is perfectly white.&quot;</p>
                        <p class="text-teal-700 font-semibold text-center mt-4">— Patricia K., Beverly Hills</p>
                    </div>
