        <section id="process" class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
            <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center text-teal-700 mb-16">Your Simple Path to Clear Eyes</h2>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center max-w-6xl mx-auto">
                    <div class="card p-8">
                        <div class="text-5xl text-teal-600 mb-4">&#128197;</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3">Step 1: Your Consultation</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600">Meet with our team to confirm your pterygium, discuss your cosmetic goals, and answer all your questions. We&apos;ll map out your simple, personalized plan.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card p-8">
                        <div class="text-5xl text-teal-600 mb-4">&#9992;&#65039;</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3">Step 2: The 20-Min Procedure</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600">Your procedure is performed in-office. It&apos;s quick, painless (your eye is numbed), and uses our advanced &quot;no-stitch&quot; technique for maximum comfort.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card p-8">
                        <div class="text-5xl text-teal-600 mb-4">&#127968;</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3">Step 3: Clear-Eye Recovery</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600">You&apos;ll go home the same day. The eye will heal over the next couple of weeks, revealing a clear, white, and natural-looking result that you can be confident about.</p>
                    </div>
